<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-στᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for rebels, rebellious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θράσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, ἔχειν</span> to be <i>ready for
				revolt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				15
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον, φρονούντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.354.6
				</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς πράττειν
				τοῦ λόγου</span> Chrysipp. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.406
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>disposed to exfoliate,</i> of bones, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>belonging to</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόστασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					1.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχήματα</span> ibid., Aps.<i><span class="en">
				p.259
			</span></i> H.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1389.28
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					635.58
				</span></i>
			.</div>
